guidelines for 9.1.0 (usernames,

547
00:39:15.301 --> 00:39:23.680
TLS); DISA Infoblox NIOS 9.x STIG
V1R1, V-285296, V-285297 and V-285260.

548
00:39:24.430 --> 00:39:26.830
Part 4: operate and evidence.

549
00:39:26.830 --> 00:39:28.773
First upgrades: the five steps,

550
00:39:28.773 --> 00:39:32.892
the point at which you can no longer
go back, and long-term support.

551
00:39:32.892 --> 00:39:33.904
Then patching.

552
00:39:33.904 --> 00:39:38.330
Then backup and restore, and how to
recover if the Grid Master is lost.

553
00:39:38.330 --> 00:39:41.855
Then logging to the SIEM, and
what can and can't be automated.

554
00:39:41.855 --> 00:39:46.354
And finally the whole build mapped
onto the Federal Modernization

555
00:39:46.354 --> 00:39:51.255
Workbook's Book 08's six phases, with
the decisions and vendor asks to close.

556
00:39:51.255 --> 00:39:56.978
